# Server / API

- New routes: `server/api/{db|bgg|tesera|common}/name.get.ts` or `.post.ts`; auth catch-all is `server/api/auth/[...all].ts`.
- Domain DB: `#server/db` (Drizzle). Auth identity: `requireUser` / `useAuthUser` (Better Auth). Pictures: write under `public/gamebox-pics/`.
- Map DB ↔ UI in `server/transformers.ts` (`*FromDb` / `*ToDb`); do not scatter snake↔camel mapping in pages.
- Domain handlers: `throw createError({ statusCode, statusMessage })` on failure.
- BGG/Tesera proxies: keep returning soft errors (`{ items: [], error }`) unless changing intentionally.
- TG Login: Better Auth Telegram plugin + widget (`authClient`); profile upsert via `upsert-profile` hooks.
- Notifications: `telegramNotify` / `sendTelegramMessage`; pgmq store is a no-op — do not enable scheduled `telegram:send-messages` without ask.
- Bots under `server/telegram-bots/*` are standalone; starter plugin currently launches none.
- BGG rate limit plugin serializes `/api/bgg/*` — avoid bypassing it for new BGG calls.
